        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dragon2439/{size}/2230_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-04T21:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wonder how the GTG team feels about their characters/art/game being compared to Marvel or DC comic story/art.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I will admit as soon as I saw the incap side for that legacy my brain immediately went \"captain america\". I try not to draw parallels between Sotm and other comic book stuff as it almost feels unfair. Like having an older brother that became famous and you are just constantly reminded of them. Poor Loki....oops&nbsp;</p>",
