      {
        "id": 88490,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-04T21:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>From conversations with the &gt;G folks, these are meant as homages, purposefully referencing classic moments in some media the &gt;G folks enjoy/appreciate (not all are comic-related). So yeah, definitely references to other things. And from what I can tell, they love it when we catch the references - it's why they put them there (and to entertain themselves, of course  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> ).</p>",
